{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Santi Space Agency</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a reporter sent to investigate a private space agency, whose employees has mysteriously vanished. As you enter the agency building, you realised that you are stuck in an endless loop. The layout of the office seems to be identical even as you take the lift to the upper floors, but something feels out of place and you have to figure out what it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Observation Horror:</strong> You might have entered what seemed like the same office, but how can you be sure that everything's the same?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/Screenshot_2025-05-11_001749.png?t=1746894468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/Screenshot_2025-05-11_001152.png?t=1746894468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera-Based Interactions:</strong> Your camera isn't for capturing the scenery. Capturing anomalies is your only way to directly with them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/camera-feature.gif?t=1746894468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Review your photos:</strong>\u00a0Can't remember everything? You can look through what you have taken but be warned, your camera has limited storage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste